.TH g-workflow-info 1  "g-workflow-info " 
.SH NAME
g\-workflow\-info \- Show detailed workflow information
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBg\-workflow\-info\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show detailed workflow information
.PP
Displays the full workflow configuration including ASCII diagram, use cases, pros/cons, and branch type details.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Workflow name (preset or custom)
